[00:18.87]Rejoice, give glory to Jehovah,
[00:23.14]For the heavens proclaim all his righteousness.
[00:28.96]Let us sing to our God joyful songs to his praise;
[00:34.20]Let us speak to all of his great acts.
[00:39.27](Chorus)
[00:39.42]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[00:44.72]For Jehovah has become our King!
[00:49.92]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[00:55.14]For Jehovah has become our King!
[01:26.85]His glory tell among the nations;
[01:30.95]For Jehovah to us is a God who saves.
[01:36.47]Yes, Jehovah is King; he deserves all the praise.
[01:42.01]So we bow before his mighty throne.
